OverTheWire Bandit: Level 29 → 30

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 30.
The password is stored in a Git tag, not in the commit history or branches.

Steps
Log in as bandit29 and clone the repository:
ssh bandit29@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
git clone ssh://bandit29@localhost/home/bandit29-git/repo
cd repo
List available Git tags:
git tag
View the content of the tag:
git show <tag-name>

Result
The tag content reveals the password for Bandit Level 30.
